g we want to  cook the feelings in a pan heat oil over  medium-high heat stir in the garlic  onion bell pepper mushrooms cherry  tomatoes and spinach saute for about 3  to 4 minutes or until vegetables are  slightly tender and spinach is wilted  then season with a pinch of salt and  continue to stir and set aside next  let's prep the tofu filling so add the  tofu and a pinch of salt to a food  processor and blend until smooth if it's  too thick then add a little bit of water  set aside once the crust is ready remove  from the oven and we want to fill it up  with the cooked vegetables and top up  with the tofu mixture then return to the  oven and bake for another 10 to 15  minutes or until the tofu is  golden-brown and firm remove from oven  and allow the muffins to cool down the  tofu will continue to firm up as the  muffin cools down for most vegans tofu  is a huge part of your diet it contains  10 grams of protein a half cup serving  so tofu is also very low in calories and  great for weight loss but then so the  tofu is of the higher the protein  content so firm tofu has higher protein  content in comparison to silken tofu and  when it comes to buying tofu always opt  for the organic version to avoid a  genetically modified soya or any harmful  pesticides which can do more harm than  good if you consume 3 tofu muffins for  breakfast you will be having 339  calories and 14.5 grams of protein plus  2 servings of vegetables spinach is a  great green leafy vegetables to enjoy as  much as you want and it is high in  protein so one cup of cooked spinach has  more than 5 grams of protein so this is  a great breakfast to kick start your day  for lunch  let's make chickpeas tofu scramble wrap  this recipe is convenient and you can  just grab and go when you need it what  you'll need are half a can of chickpeas  100 grams of firm tofu cut a cup of  cherry tomato half cut a cup of red bell  pepper diced cut a cup of onion diced 1  tablespoon of olive oil 1/2 a teaspoon  of 