 the sauce thickens don't forget to stir  occasionally and if necessary add some  water finally garnish with coriander and  serve with a side of rice some of you  might not even have heard of temper but  if you get a chance to do give it a try  tempeh is a fermented form of soya  that's high in protein easy to digest  and reach in probiotics it has 12 grams  of protein per cup it is nutty chewy and  has a distinct flavor you might not  enjoy temper on your first few tries but  do give it a try again and eventually  you will grow to love the texture and  also taste black beans are my favorite 1  cup of cooked black beans has 15 grams  of protein and it is also low English  scenic index this means by adding that  beans into your diet you will feel full  and satisfied for a long time and it is  also great for weight loss so this one  serving with rice has 421 calories and  23 grams of protein all this recipes can  be prepped ahead and you can keep them  in the fridge for after three days so  add two quarter cup servings of trail  mix as part of the snacks and you will  be meeting your daily protein  requirements of 67 grams of protein  which is enough for my activity level  and to maintain a good health so guys it  is possible to get your protein from  plant base  what's your favorite plant-based source  of protein let me know in the comments  below try this recipe out snaps and  share your cooking with me attack me at  Joanna so official and hashtag chaser  recipes don't forget to also subscribe  to my youtube channel for a lot more  healthy recipes and also workout videos  do also turn on your notification button  so that you will get notified every time  I share a new video all the best
 

